resources.string:
① Tap "Open Preview" and grant camera permission on first use (cascade models are copied on first launch, please wait a moment);
② A red box appears and tracks the face in real time; frontal, left and right profile faces (multi-cascade fusion) are all detectable, evenly lit scenes work best;
③ Tap "Switch Camera" to toggle front/back; tracking resets and re-detects after switching;
④ Tap "Close Preview" or go back to the main screen to release the camera;
⑤ Note: frontal faces are detected by a union of two models and profile faces by a dedicated model; heavy occlusion or long distances may still cause misses.
